			"othercredits"
			{
				"english"		"\"Arise (Feat. Krysta Youngs)\"\r\nPerformed by Hydelic & Krysta Youngs\r\nWritten by Krysta Youngs & Noboru Mutoh\r\nProduced by Hydelic\r\n\r\n\"Sky Falls Down (feat. Luma)\"\r\nPerformed by Hydelic & Luma\r\nWritten by Brittany Cannarozzi & Noboru Mutoh\r\nProduced by Hydelic\r\n\r\n\"Two Lost Stars (feat. Luma)\"\r\nPerformed by Hydelic & Luma\r\nWritten by Brittany Cannarozzi & Noboru Mutoh\r\nProduced by Hydelic\r\n\r\n\"Wash Away (feat. Kymara)\"\r\nPerformed by Hydelic & Kymara\r\nWritten by Kymara & Noboru Mutoh\r\nProduced by Hydelic\r\n\r\n\"Run It Up (feat. Jamell Patten & Krysta Youngs)\"\r\nPerformed by Hydelic, Jamell Patten (Komorebi Audio) & Krysta Youngs\r\nWritten by Jamell Patten (Komorebi Audio), Krysta Youngs & Noboru Mutoh\r\nProduced by Hydelic\r\n\r\n\"Losing It (feat. Honey-B-Sweet)\"\r\nPerformed by Hydelic & Honey-B-Sweet\r\nWritten by Honey-B-Sweet & Noboru Mutoh\r\nProduced by Hydelic\r\n\r\n\"Not Alone (feat. Sean Christopher)\"\r\nPerformed by Hydelic & Sean Christopher\r\nWritten by Sean Christopher & Noboru Mutoh\r\nProduced by Hydelic\r\n\r\n\"Only Human (Feat. Krysta Youngs)\"\r\nPerformed by Hydelic & Krysta Youngs\r\nWritten by Krysta Youngs & Noboru Mutoh\r\nProduced by Hydelic\r\n\r\nLighthouse / Ancient Scales / Reboot / Dreamland /Shuffles / Bloom of Tender / 1999 / Moments / Two Drops / The List / Echoes in the Dark / Silent Bell / Sleepless Awakeness / Bass Cycles / L.O.M. / Find Myself / Lost in lights / Better End / Amber Song / Love\r\nPerformed & Produced by Hydelic\r\nWritten by Noboru Mutoh\r\n\r\nSnow Murmur / Mark I: Awakening / Conductor of the Table / Swarm Within / Bloom Pulse / Remembrance Winds / Home Glimmer / Black and White Play\r\nPerformed & Written by Takako Ishida\r\nProduced by Takako Ishida, Tetsuya Mizuguchi & Takashi Ishihara\r\n\r\n\r\nAll music tracks are published by Enhance Experience Inc.\r\nCourtesy of Resonair, All rights reserved.\r\n\r\nAlbum art by Cory Schmitz."
